      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, for the first one, you would probably need to convince vrchat that what you're asking for is not properly served by the group's system. To me it sounds like you're currently creating like Friends+ when you want a Groups+ and maybe you're wanting a Group Public instance instead of trying to manage a regular Public instance.\n\nFor the second one, creators can do that if they want. Personally I would want that disabled in my world. At least with my world it's a quirky place with some neat things, and I like it not being super obvious that I'm the author.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-04T06:37:02.536Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to suggest several quality-of-life improvements for instance management and creator recognition:\n\n1. Instance Moderator System\n\nAllow the Instance Owner (creator of the instance) to appoint Moderators.\n\nAdmin (Instance Owner):\n\nCan kick, mute, and ban players\n\nCan appoint and remove Moderators\n\nModerators:\n\nCan kick and mute players\n\nAdd clear visual indicators above the head:\n\nRed crown + \"Admin\" label for the instance owner\n\nBlue shield + \"Moderator\" label for appointed moderators\n\n2. World Creator Role\n\nWhen the creator of the world joins their own world, they automatically receive a special Emerald Green rank with the label \"World Creator\".\n\nThis would help players instantly recognize the author of the world and show more respect to creators.\n\nThank you for your hard work!\n\nLooking forward to your thoughts.",
